{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-29933-r4615131","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:California Curry Chicken","sourcePageId":29933,"sourceRevision":"4615131","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-02-03T02:22:18Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:California%20Curry%20Chicken&oldid=4615131","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:08.141Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Californian recipes","Category:Gluten-free recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for curry","Category:Recipes using bay leaf","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cardamom","Category:Recipes using chicken","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using coconut milk","Category:Recipes using curry powder","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using mustard powder","Category:Recipes using potato","Category:Stir fry recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"07d156fb7a24fc3ba2d479ec14d9803312d81955189773edae3887bb7917c10a","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary|category=Chicken recipes|servings=4|time=45 minutes|difficulty=3}}\n\n{{recipe}}| [[Cookbook:Curry|Curry]] \n\nThis dish is an attempt to replicate the flavor of curry chicken dishes that are served at Indian restaurants in California.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n===Meat and vegetables===\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[cookbook:Oil|cooking oil]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]] yellow [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]] [[cookbook:garlic|garlic]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] boneless [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]] meat, cut into cubes\n* 6 small [[cookbook:potato|potatoes]], peeled, quartered, and cooked (boiled, baked, or steamed)\n\n===Spices===\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] mild [[Cookbook:Curry Powder|curry powder]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Chiles|chile]] powder\n* 1 tbsp [[cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] ground [[cookbook:Cumin|cumin]]\n* 1 tsp [[cookbook:Garlic Powder|garlic powder]]\n* 2 tsp [[cookbook:Cardamom|cardamom]] powder\n* 1 tsp [[cookbook:Turmeric|turmeric]] powder\n* 1 tsp [[cookbook:mustard|mustard]] powder\n* ¼ tsp ground [[cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Bay Leaf|bay leaf]]\n\n===Sauce===\n*1 ½ cups (12 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]]) [[Cookbook:Coconut Milk|coconut milk]]\n*3 cups [[cookbook:water|water]]\n*1 cup [[cookbook:yogurt|yogurt]]\n*1 can (12 oz) diced [[cookbook:tomato|tomatoes]], with liquid\n*4 tbsp [[cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n\n===Thickener===\n*¼–½ cup of instant mashed potato flakes\n\n*[[cookbook:salt|Salt]] to taste\n*[[cookbook:pepper|Pepper]] to taste\n\n==Procedure==\n#Heat cooking oil in a 4-quart [[cookbook:stockpot|stockpot]].\n#Add onions and garlic. [[cookbook:Fry|Fry]] for about 1 minute.\n#Add chicken. [[Cookbook:Stir-frying|Stir-fry]] for about 5 minutes.\n#Add cooked potatoes.\n#Add all the spices, and stir to coat chicken and potatoes. Cook for about 5 minutes more.\n#Add sauce ingredients, stir well, bring to a [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]], and cook for 10 minutes.\n#Add ¼ cup of mashed potato flakes, and stir until curry is thickened. If a thicker curry is desired, add additional potato flakes a tablespoon at a time until desired thickness is achieved.\n#Add salt and pepper to taste.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n*Serve with [[Cookbook:Steaming|steamed]] [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]].\n\n{{DEFAULTSORT:{{PAGENAME}}}}\n\n[[Category:Californian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes for curry]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[category:Gluten-free recipes]]\n[[Category:Stir fry recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bay leaf]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cardamom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut milk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using curry powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mustard powder]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"California Curry Chicken","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 tbsp cooking oil","sourceText":"4 tbsp cooking oil","amountText":"4 tbsp cooking oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup diced yellow onions","sourceText":"1 cup diced yellow onions","amountText":"1 cup diced yellow onions","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tsp minced garlic","sourceText":"2 tsp minced garlic","amountText":"2 tsp minced garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 lb boneless chicken meat, cut into cubes","sourceText":"1 lb boneless chicken meat, cut into cubes","amountText":"1 lb boneless chicken meat, cut into cubes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"6 small potatoes, peeled, quartered, and cooked (boiled, baked, or steamed)","sourceText":"6 small potatoes, peeled, quartered, and cooked (boiled, baked, or steamed)","amountText":"6 small potatoes, peeled, quar